      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data model, in short:\n\nJob — status (lifecycle enum), baseAssetUrl, posterUrl,\nbaseLayerSpecJson, styleSpecJson\n\nStageAttempt — one row per attempt: stage, attemptNumber,\nqaScore, qaReasoning, assetUrl, result (PASS/RETRY/ESCALATED)\n\nDimensionJob — one row per aspect ratio, own status + asset",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "hld0003HRSB",
      "originalText": "Data model, in short:\n\nJob — status (lifecycle enum), baseAssetUrl, posterUrl,\nbaseLayerSpecJson, styleSpecJson\n\nStageAttempt — one row per attempt: stage, attemptNumber,\nqaScore, qaReasoning, assetUrl, result (PASS/RETRY/ESCALATED)\n\nDimensionJob — one row per aspect ratio, own status + asset",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
