      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787691477922,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Retry / Escalate rule — the SAME rule for every AI-judged step above, and for each dimension_* job below (handle-stage-result.ts):\n\nqaScore >= 7  →  PASS, advance to the next stage\nqaScore < 7  and attempt < 2  →  RETRY (same stage re-run, judge's own reasoning appended to the prompt)\nqaScore < 7  and attempt == 2  →  NEEDS_ATTENTION (job — or just that one dimension — pauses for a human)\n\nA paused job/dimension is resumed by a human via POST /api/v1/jobs/:id/retry. Technical failures (bad key, 429/5xx) are retried\nby BullMQ itself and never eat into this content-quality budget.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "hld0036Vgnr",
      "originalText": "Retry / Escalate rule — the SAME rule for every AI-judged step above, and for each dimension_* job below (handle-stage-result.ts):\n\nqaScore >= 7  →  PASS, advance to the next stage\nqaScore < 7  and attempt < 2  →  RETRY (same stage re-run, judge's own reasoning appended to the prompt)\nqaScore < 7  and attempt == 2  →  NEEDS_ATTENTION (job — or just that one dimension — pauses for a human)\n\nA paused job/dimension is resumed by a human via POST /api/v1/jobs/:id/retry. Technical failures (bad key, 429/5xx) are retried\nby BullMQ itself and never eat into this content-quality budget.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
